# Build-time configuration for the Vercel deployment, applied by
# `vite build --mode vercel` (see the build:vercel script in package.json).
#
# The UI and the API share one domain there; vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the
# Python service. This MUST match the backend's API_PREFIX, or the page will
# load perfectly while every request 404s.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
